  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">DRRS Malaysia 2024 &#x2013; Deployment I</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The region of Sabak Bernam in western Malaysia has seen a number of impactful flood events over the past years. The government od Malaysia has requested the Netherlands to assist in coming up with an innovative way to address these issues sustainably.The focus will be on the use of nature-based solutions in the river basin area of Sabak Bernam and how to make stakeholders ready for the implementation in the next budget cycle of the Malaysian authorities.</narrative>
  </description>
